Z||000012||The Fieromaster||07-07-2001||01:58 AM||||Sweet, it all went good had to run a wire from the ignition wire (thick yellow one in car) bypassing the firewall harness and go straight to the wire in the junction block... Dunno why but without doing it the car wouldnt start!  James was flipping when the car wouldnt start!  As was I... Many another hole in the garage wall...<P>*WARNING FLYING TOOLS*<P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That Wrecked Better"<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">     <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>AIM: Fieromaster<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
